---
// Ties renting to the mission: renting a room keeps a community gathering
// place open. Shown on the rental and use-case pages. Static.
// Before launch, confirm with Wellspring how rental income is used and
// sharpen the wording (e.g. "Every rental helps fund free programs").
---

<section aria-label="How your rental helps" class="mission-note">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="icon-tile">
      <svg aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 3c3 4 5 6.5 5 9.5a5 5 0 0 1-10 0C7 9.5 9 7 12 3z"></path></svg>
    </span>
    <div>
      <h2 class="mission-title">Your event keeps the well running</h2>
      <p>
        Wellspring on Main is run by a nonprofit, the Arlington Center for Community Engagement. When you rent
        here, you help keep a gathering place open for programs and projects that serve all of Downtown Arlington.
      </p>
      <a href="/programs" class="text-link">See what happens here →</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
